# Dancers in Distress (WotG 9). Lion Springs at status 0: its message. Raustigne: 86; finished: status 1. Elegant
# Footprints in Jugner Forest [S] at status 1: 2; updated with option 1 and 18 (no reply), then 19 (a random choice of
# the quiz item, answered as the 8th operand); finished: status 2 and mustZone. At status 2, before zoning: a trade of
# each quiz item plays nothing; the trigger: LILISETTE_IS_PREPARING. After a zone change and back, the trades of the
# three quiz items in turn: the one of the choice plays 3; finished: the mission completes (the trade taken, Daughter
# of a Knight current).
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Lion_Springs/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/Raustigne/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/86 JugnerForestS/Elegant_Footprints/onTrigger JugnerForestS/Elegant_Footprints/onTrade JugnerForestS/onEventUpdate/2 JugnerForestS/onEventFinish/2 JugnerForestS/onEventFinish/3
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=96,0,106 job=WAR lvl=99
item LynxMeat
item GoldBeastcoin
item NyumomoDoll
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg DancersInDistress current
login
trigger Lion_Springs                    # status 0: its message
finish-if-event
warp 3.979,-1.999,44.456 SouthernSanDoriaS
trigger Raustigne                       # 86
finish                                  # status 1
warp 46.387,0.117,318.21 JugnerForestS
trigger Elegant_Footprints              # status 1: 2
update 2 option=1                       # no reply
update 2 option=18                      # no reply
update 2 option=19                      # the quiz item chosen
finish                                  # status 2; mustZone
trade Elegant_Footprints LynxMeat x1    # mustZone: nothing
trade Elegant_Footprints GoldBeastcoin x1
trade Elegant_Footprints NyumomoDoll x1
trigger Elegant_Footprints              # LILISETTE_IS_PREPARING
warp 96,0,106 SouthernSanDoriaS
warp 46.387,0.117,318.21 JugnerForestS                   # zoned: mustZone clear
trade Elegant_Footprints LynxMeat x1
finish-if-event
trade Elegant_Footprints GoldBeastcoin x1
finish-if-event
trade Elegant_Footprints NyumomoDoll x1
finish-if-event
